<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Revenues</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
currently produce our products for our customers in three broad product categories: fragrance compounds, health supplemental (powder
drinks) and bioactive food ingredients.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Total
revenues were $10,183,553 in the six months ended March 31, 2024, a decrease of $3,966,414 or approximately 28.0% as compared to $14,149,967
in the same period of 2023. Specifically, the decrease in revenues was primarily attributable to (i) an overall decrease in sales volume
of fragrance compound and health supplemental powder drinks by 87.0% and 52.0%, respectively, due to the decline in customer and market
demand; (ii) we sold our products to 81 and 94 customers in the six months ended March 31, 2024 and 2023, respectively, representing
a decrease of 13.8%. In terms of purchase order size, the average purchase order by our customers decreased by 16.0% from approximately
$150,000 per customer in the six months ended March 31, 2023 to approximately $126,000 per customer in the six months ended March 31,
2024. For the six months ended March 31, 2024, two customers accounted for 58.2% and 20.0% of the Company&#8217;s total revenue, respectively.
For the six months ended March 31, 2023, three customers accounted for 43.3%, 32.9% and 14.2% of the Company&#8217;s total revenue, respectively;
(iii) offset by a 3.3% negative impact from foreign currency fluctuation when average exchange rate used in converting RMB into USD changed
from US$1 to RMB 6.9761 in the six months ended March 31, 2023 to US$1 to RMB 7.2064 in the same period of 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


