<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">General
and administrative expenses increased by $424,497, or 29.0%, from $1,465,955 in the six months ended March 31, 2023, to $1,890,452 in
the same period of 2024, mainly attributable to (i) a 59.6% or $485,534 increase in professional service and consulting fees to $1,300,608
in the six months ended March 31, 2024 from $815,074 in the same period of 2023; and (ii) the increase was offset by the decrease in
staff payroll from $297,624 in the six months ended March 31, 2023 to $220,236 compared to the same period of 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

