<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>BON
NATURAL LIFE LIMITED AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
4 &#8212; ACCOUNTS RECEIVABLE, NET (continued)</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s accounts receivable primarily includes balance due from customers when the Company&#8217;s products are sold and delivered
to customers. Approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--AccountsReceivableNetCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20230930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsReceivableMember_zRWg3bPzlisa" title="Accounts receivable, net"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember" id="Fact001269" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million or <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--AccountReceivablePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20221001__20230930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsReceivableMember_zrmb1VO63A9j" title="Account receivable, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="BON:AccountReceivablePercentage" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember" id="Fact001271" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">75.8</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the net accounts receivable balance as of September 30, 2023 has been collected
as of the date of the Company&#8217;s consolidated financial statements are released.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

