<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Depreciation
expense was $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20221001__20230930_z1iACtSGzWvd" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30" id="Fact001407" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">945,507</ix:nonFraction></span>, $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20211001__20220930_zuSjzZ3KmQxd" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2021-10-012022-09-30" id="Fact001409" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">210,916</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20201001__20210930_zckD56KX3EC9" title="Depreciation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2020-10-012021-09-30" id="Fact001411" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">219,906</ix:nonFraction></span> for the years ended September 30, 2023, 2022 and 2021, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F0B_zAgEF9sbRCmk" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(1)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F12_zwxdj2CE2RRh" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001412" xml:lang="en-US">Construction-in-progress
    (&#8220;CIP&#8221;) represents direct costs of construction incurred for the Company&#8217;s manufacturing facilities. On August
    16, 2017, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Xi&#8217;an App-Chem Bio (Tech) Co.,Ltd. started to construct a new manufacturing plant
    in Tongchuan City (&#8220;Tongchuan Project&#8221;), Shaanxi Province, with total budget of RMB <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_pn5n6_uRMB_c20230930__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember_zoiZlbZhzQog" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember" id="Fact001414" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">95.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million (approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_pn5n6_uUSD_c20230930__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember_zT1UMLuSFii2" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember" id="Fact001416" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">13.4</ix:nonFraction></span>
    million) for construction of the main body of the manufacturing plant, plant decoration and purchase of machinery and equipment.
    The total budget increased to RMB <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress_iI_pn5n6_uRMB_c20230930_zfvvrRyNFkw4" title="Future minimum capital expenditures on construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="BON:FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30" id="Fact001418" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">114.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million (approximately $<span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress_iI_pn5n6_uUSD_c20230930_zcDEdzFzSHlk" title="Future minimum capital expenditures on construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="BON:FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30" id="Fact001420" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">16.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million) on July 2, 2021 due to increased material and labor
    cost, as well as longer construction period caused by COVID-19 pandemic. The construction of Tongchuan Project was fully completed
    and put into production in December 2022, of which $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_uUSD_c20230930__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__custom--BulidingsAndMachinaeryMember_z9M9V1puT3lb" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_BulidingsAndMachinaeryMember" id="Fact001422" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">10,678,336</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_uUSD_c20230930__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__custom--EquipmentAndFurnitureMember_zOtnYjoVE9sj" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_EquipmentAndFurnitureMember" id="Fact001424" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">4,305,847</ix:nonFraction></span> were transferred to Buildings and Machinery, equipment
    and furniture, respectively, from CIP as of September 30, 2023. </ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A4_z8ousYlN2lqf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


