expenses were $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_c20221001__20230930_z3GJssW2VJf9" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30" id="Fact001465" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">9,010</ix:nonFraction></span>, $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_c20211001__20220930_zYGKI9c4GmTa" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2021-10-012022-09-30" id="Fact001467" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">7,610</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_c20201001__20210930_zLByj66FELR1" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2020-10-012021-09-30" id="Fact001469" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">8,641</ix:nonFraction></span> for the years ended September 30, 2023, 2022 and 2021, respectively. Estimated future amortization
expense for intangible assets is as follows:</span></p>

