Long-term loans:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_8BD_zT71efp3jam5" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF LONG -TERM LOANS</span></span></p>

