<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(8)
On February 11, 2022, Xi&#8217;an App-Chem, entered into another loan agreement with China Resources Shenzhen International Investment
Trust to borrow RMB <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_uRMB_c20220211__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zZjnQNOd7bgi" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-11_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001730" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="RMB">566,667</ix:nonFraction></span> (equivalent to US$<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_uUSD_c20220211__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zHkHCJjzZNt2" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-11_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001732" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">79,661</ix:nonFraction></span>) loans <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription_c20220208__20220211__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zShncm9NUSW1" title="Debt maturity date, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-02-082022-02-11_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001734" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription">as working capital for two years, with maturity date on February 12, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span>
and interest rate of <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220211__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zunJW1eH0Bw5" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-11_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001736" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">12.6</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. Loans from China Resources Shenzhen International Investment Trust in the amount of RMB <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_uRMB_c20220211__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_znd5NMWifNOi" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-11_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember207168281" id="Fact001738" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="RMB">166,667</ix:nonFraction></span>
(equivalent to US$ $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_uUSD_c20220211__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_ztlOerekYUU2" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-11_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember207168281" id="Fact001740" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">22,844</ix:nonFraction></span>) was reclassified as current portion of long-term loans as of September 30, 2023.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
March 1, 2022, Tianjin YHX, entered into a loan agreement with China Resources Shenzhen International Investment Trust, to borrow RMB
<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_uRMB_c20220301__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_z5sDnVu4yfP9" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2022-03-01_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001742" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">0.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million (equivalent to US$<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_uUSD_c20220301__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zcHv123NrnZi" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2022-03-01_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001744" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">99,576</ix:nonFraction></span>) <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription_c20220301__20220301__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zCU4dPJ6Ycy9" title="Debt maturity date, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-03-012022-03-01_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001746" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription">as working capital for 24 months, with maturity date on February 20, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span> and interest rate of
<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220301__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember_zXsI5t0NJDe8" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-03-01_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaResourcesShenzhenInternationalInvestmentTrustOneMember" id="Fact001748" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">16.2</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. The amount was repaid in fully during September 30, 2023.</span></p>

