    <td style="text-align: left">Total due to related parties</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">$</td><td id="xdx_985_eus-gaap--OtherLiabilitiesCurrent_iI_pp0p0_c20230930__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_z8VU6hmbxnHl" title="Due to related parties" style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact001884" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">83,380</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">$</td><td id="xdx_98B_eus-gaap--OtherLiabilitiesCurrent_iI_pp0p0_c20220930__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zjCprqHYPWMk" title="Due to related parties" style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2022-09-30_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact001886" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">72,836</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of September 30, 2023 and 2022, the balance of due to related parties was comprised of the Company&#8217;s borrowings from related parties
and was used for working capital during the Company&#8217;s normal course of business. Such advance was non-interest bearing and due
on demand.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(b)
Due from related parties</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

