  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A3_zPBVTLoD8I97" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of September 30, 2023 and 2022, Company had accrued tax liabilities of approximately $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--TaxesPayableCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20230930__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__country--CN_z6ZfBdQkXVj" title="Accrued tax liabilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_country_CN" id="Fact002039" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--TaxesPayableCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20220930__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__country--CN_zzXfTTEsu0W3" title="Accrued tax liabilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2022-09-30_country_CN" id="Fact002041" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively, mostly
related to the unpaid value added tax and income tax in China.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


