</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AF_zRcAaQM73kyd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the years ended September 30, 2023, 2022 and 2021, stock-based compensation associated with amortization of stock option expense was
$<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20221001__20230930__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_zFECvnjKXP63" title="Share based compensation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" id="Fact002277" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">131,092</ix:nonFraction></span>, $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20211001__20220930__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_zoSNq76A0e76" title="Share based compensation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2021-10-012022-09-30_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" id="Fact002279" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">170,883</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20201001__20210930__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_zb81bs47kj8k" title="Share based compensation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2020-10-012021-09-30_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" id="Fact002281" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">44,910</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. All stock-based compensation was recorded as a component of general and administrative
expense.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

