<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>BON
NATURAL LIFE LIMITED AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>PARENT
COMPANY BALANCE SHEETS</b></span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30" escape="true" id="Fact002444" name="srt:ScheduleOfCondensedFinancialStatementsTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_896_esrt--ScheduleOfCondensedFinancialStatementsTableTextBlock_zWaukjkOn9G9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="display: none; font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8BF_zKsj9qvBBTC">SCHEDULE
OF PARENT COMPANY FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</span></span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_30B_134_zc9zaiFgsyLb" summary="xdx: Disclosure - SCHEDULE OF PARENT COMPANY BALANCE SHEETS (Details)" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
