<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>BON
NATURAL LIFE LIMITED AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO UNAUDITED CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
4 &#8212; ACCOUNTS RECEIVABLE, NET (continued)</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s accounts receivable primarily includes balance due from customers when the Company&#8217;s products are sold and delivered
to customers. Approximately $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AccountsReceivableNetCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20240331__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsReceivableMember_zObRyWeq5GOk" title="Accounts receivable, net"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-03-31_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember" id="Fact003563" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">7.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million or <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--AccountReceivablePercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20231001__20240331__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsReceivableMember_zYFdgpMDjlQ1" title="Account receivable, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="BON:AccountReceivablePercentage" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-03-31_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember" id="Fact003565" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">95.1</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the net Accounts receivable balance as of March 31, 2024 has been collected as of
the date of the Company&#8217;s unaudited condensed consolidated interim financial statements are released.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

