<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Depreciation
expense was $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20231001__20240331_zgZqb6zbhrOb" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2023-10-01to2024-03-31" id="Fact003703" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">672,894</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20221001__20230331_zM3M5QqO0oPa" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-03-31" id="Fact003705" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">277,447</ix:nonFraction></span> for the six months ended March 31, 2024 and 2023, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td id="xdx_F07_zNmSzTZRqv51" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(1)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F1F_z84E8i3Vzw9a" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote003706" xml:lang="en-US">Construction-in-progress
    (&#8220;CIP&#8221;) represents direct costs of construction incurred for the Company&#8217;s manufacturing facilities. On August
    16, 2017, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Xi&#8217;an App-Chem Bio (Tech) Co.,Ltd. started to construct a new manufacturing plant
    in Tongchuan City (&#8220;Tongchuan Project&#8221;), Shaanxi Province, with total budget of RMB <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_pn5n6_uRMB_c20230930__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember_zGVw2rWD1fsc" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember" id="Fact003708" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">95.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million (approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_pn5n6_uUSD_c20230930__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember_zlhRi0sAQ5bi" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_XianAppChemBioTechCoLtdMember" id="Fact003710" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">13.4</ix:nonFraction>
    </span>million) for construction of the main body of the manufacturing plant, plant decoration and purchase of machinery and equipment.
    The total budget increased to RMB <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress_iI_pn5n6_uRMB_c20230930_zTRlsGKbcwD2" title="Future minimum capital expenditures on construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="BON:FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30" id="Fact003712" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">114.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million (approximately $<span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress_iI_pn5n6_uUSD_c20230930_zQRsDydMXKxl" title="Future minimum capital expenditures on construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="BON:FutureMinimumCapitalExpendituresOnConstructioninprogress" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30" id="Fact003714" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">16.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million) on July 2, 2021 due to increased material and labor
    cost, as well as longer construction period caused by COVID-19 pandemic. The construction of Tongchuan Project was fully completed
    and put into production in December 2022, of which $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_uUSD_c20230930__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__custom--BulidingsAndMachinaeryMember_zKIBCIhO7ye6" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_BulidingsAndMachinaeryMember" id="Fact003716" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">10,678,336</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConstructionInProgressGross_iI_uUSD_c20230930__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__custom--EquipmentAndFurnitureMember_zscBWKtb39fb" title="Construction in progress" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIFBST1BFUlRZLCBQTEFOVCwgQU5EIEVRVUlQTUVOVCAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConstructionInProgressGross" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_EquipmentAndFurnitureMember" id="Fact003718" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">4,305,847</ix:nonFraction></span> were transferred to Buildings and Machinery, equipment
    and furniture, respectively, from CIP as of September 30, 2023. </ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A1_zV8ZfSaSEnv4" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>


