of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20220518__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankTwoMember_zWNc6cgCB49j" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-05-18_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankTwoMember" id="Fact003869" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.96</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. The loan was fully repaid upon maturity.</span></p>

