y 15, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span></ix:nonNumeric></span> and interest rate of <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20230515__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankTwoMember_zMtdXrtVAf2" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-05-15_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankTwoMember" id="Fact003879" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.80</ix:nonFraction></span>%
