date on March 13, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span> and interest rate of<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20230314__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--ChinaConstructionBankTwoMember_zc88MIVOM21i" title="Interest rate"> <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-03-14_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_ChinaConstructionBankTwoMember" id="Fact003907" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.70</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(6)
On March 31, 2024, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Xi&#8217;an App-Chem, entered into a loan agreement with Agricultural Bank of China
