per annum and maturity date on <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20240331__20240331__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--AgriculturalBankOfChinaMember_z8NzWIPLaEWk" title="Debt maturity date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-03-312024-03-31_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_AgriculturalBankOfChinaMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="Fact003915" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">March 31, 2025</ix:nonNumeric></span>. The Company&#8217;s controlling shareholder, Mr. Yongwei Hu and his wife Ms. Jing Liu
