<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(14)
On December 10, 2020, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Xi&#8217;an App-Chem, obtained an approval of line of credit from Qishang Bank
Co., Ltd. (&#8220;Qishang Bank&#8221;) for a maximum of RMB <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20201210__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zVHkZLb4XFC7" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-10_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004117" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">13</ix:nonFraction> </span>million (approximately $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_uUSD_c20201210__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zVU37ods5jNa" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-10_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004119" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.8</ix:nonFraction></span> million) loans as working capital. On December
