December 13, 2023 and interest rate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20201215__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zyNoz4g26nJ9" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-15_custom_LoanAgreementMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004125" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6.65</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. The Company pledged certain free patent owned by the Company as collateral to
