<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(15)
On August 22, 2023, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Xi&#8217;an App-Chem, obtained a working capital loan from Bank of Communication
of RMB<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn6n6_uRMB_c20230822__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zDVc4bjrtkKg" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2023-08-22_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004135" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="RMB">3.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million ($<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_uUSD_c20230822__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zzbc0ZUoj03i" title="Long term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2023-08-22_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004137" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">411,184</ix:nonFraction></span>) with an interest rate of <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20230822__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zstpWpiXov1c" title="Interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-08-22_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004139" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">5.80</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum for three years, with a maturity date of August 21, 2026. As of
September 30, 2023, RMB<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_uRMB_c20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zGT0nsusgLSa" title="Debt instrument face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004141" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="RMB">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> ($<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--WorkingCapitalLoanMember__us-gaap--CreditFacilityAxis__custom--QishangBankMember_zPJSbWQiLblf" title="Debt instrument face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_WorkingCapitalLoanMember_custom_QishangBankMember" id="Fact004143" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">137,061</ix:nonFraction></span>) was reclassified as current portion of long-term loans as of September 30, 2023.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the above-mentioned short-term and long-term loans from PRC banks and financial institutions, interest expense amounted to $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_pp0p0_c20231001__20240331_zT84Ka8Kupsi"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2023-10-01to2024-03-31" id="Fact004144" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">143,747</ix:nonFraction></span> and
$<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_pp0p0_c20221001__20230331_zRL2dFSjzShl"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-03-31" id="Fact004145" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">178,557</ix:nonFraction></span> for the six months ended March 31, 2024 and 2023, respectively.</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

