<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of March 31, 2024 and September 30, 2023, the Company had accrued tax liabilities of approximately $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--TaxesPayableCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20240331__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__country--CN_zkjLFo9VEc9e" title="Accrued tax liabilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-03-31_country_CN" id="Fact004325" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--TaxesPayableCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20230930__srt--StatementGeographicalAxis__country--CN_zKId75TkVqH7" title="Accrued tax liabilities"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TaxesPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_country_CN" id="Fact004327" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively,
mostly related to the unpaid value added tax and income tax in China.</span></p>

