<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>BON
NATURAL LIFE LIMITED AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO UNAUDITED CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-10-01to2024-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact004558" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80C_eus-gaap--DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock_zaestcuLiAPf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
15 - <span id="xdx_820_zkcGNFKSp3v3">SHARE-BASED COMPENSATION</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 31, 2023, the Company entered into consulting agreements with a third-party consultant, which provide financial and acquisition consulting
services. The Company issued <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20230531__20230531__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AcquisitionConsultingServicesMember_zDOtFJ7QiCC8" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-05-312023-05-31_custom_ConsultantMember_custom_AcquisitionConsultingServicesMember" id="Fact004560" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of its Ordinary Shares* to the consultant in lieu of cash payments for such services. The <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20221001__20230930__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AcquisitionConsultingServicesMember_zE0egtjRq00a" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_custom_ConsultantMember_custom_AcquisitionConsultingServicesMember" id="Fact004562" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares* were valued at $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices_c20221001__20230930__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AcquisitionConsultingServicesMember_zCHbbHcBg23k" title="Number of stock issued, services, values"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_custom_ConsultantMember_custom_AcquisitionConsultingServicesMember" id="Fact004564" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">174,904</ix:nonFraction></span> and are fully expensed for the year ended September 30, 2023.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 2, 2023, the Company issued <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20230802__20230802__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LegalAdviceServicesMember_zYnhmuwYBT8k" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-08-022023-08-02_custom_ConsultantMember_custom_LegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004566" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">7,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of its Ordinary Shares* to a third-party consultant, which provide legal advice services. The
<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20221001__20230930__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LegalAdviceServicesMember_zSK3aqpe3wu" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_custom_ConsultantMember_custom_LegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004568" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">7,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares* were valued at $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices_c20221001__20230930__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LegalAdviceServicesMember_z0APC5ozP0p7" title="Number of stock issued, services, value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_custom_ConsultantMember_custom_LegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004570" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">43,400</ix:nonFraction></span> and were expensed for the year ended September 30, 2023.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
October 2, 2023, the Company issued <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20231002__20231002__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThirdPartyConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BusinessAdvicesAndLegalAdviceServicesMember_zoY34nQLqiL7" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-10-022023-10-02_custom_ThirdPartyConsultantMember_custom_BusinessAdvicesAndLegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004572" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">195,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of its Ordinary Shares* to several third-party consultants, which provide business advices
and legal services. The <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20231001__20240331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThirdPartyConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BusinessAdvicesAndLegalAdviceServicesMember_zkcWRRAuNECh" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-03-31_custom_ThirdPartyConsultantMember_custom_BusinessAdvicesAndLegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004574" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">195,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares* were valued at $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices_c20231001__20240331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThirdPartyConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BusinessAdvicesAndLegalAdviceServicesMember_zEoOeviae84" title="Number of stock issued, services, value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-03-31_custom_ThirdPartyConsultantMember_custom_BusinessAdvicesAndLegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004576" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">804,445</ix:nonFraction></span> and were expended for the six months ended March 31, 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
February 22, 2024, the Company issued <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20240222__20240222__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThirdPartyConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LegalAdviceServicesMember_z0qnzrNNiPu4" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2024-02-222024-02-22_custom_ThirdPartyConsultantMember_custom_LegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004578" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">45,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of its Ordinary Shares* to a third-party consultant, which provide legal advice services.
The <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_pid_c20231001__20240331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThirdPartyConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LegalAdviceServicesMember_zIBlKSmE1ide" title="Number of stock issued, services, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-03-31_custom_ThirdPartyConsultantMember_custom_LegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004580" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">45,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares* were valued at $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices_c20231001__20240331__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--ThirdPartyConsultantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LegalAdviceServicesMember_zyBbAq0pJmV3" title="Number of stock issued, services, value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-03-31_custom_ThirdPartyConsultantMember_custom_LegalAdviceServicesMember" id="Fact004582" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">181,395</ix:nonFraction></span> and were expensed for the six months ended March 31, 2024.</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Pursuant
to the Director Service Agreements with the Company&#8217;s independent directors and following the completion of the Company&#8217;s
IPO, on June 23, 2021, the Company granted stock options to three independent directors to purchase an aggregate of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriod_pid_c20210623__20210623__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_zo6iOhtKCcC6" title="Number of shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2021-06-232021-06-23_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact004584" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,600</ix:nonFraction></span> shares* of
the Company&#8217;s Ordinary Shares, par value of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare_iI_c20210623__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_zDIdh2TzbZzk" title="Common stock, par value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2021-06-23_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact004586" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.001</ix:nonFraction></span> per share*, at exercise price of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20210623__20210623__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_z4vwrc8g2lY1" title="Exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2021-06-232021-06-23_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact004588" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.10</ix:nonFraction></span> per share* for a fair value of total
$<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingIntrinsicValue_iI_c20210623__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_zF5HvjgbtFfb" title="Fair value of shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingIntrinsicValue" contextRef="AsOf2021-06-23_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact004590" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">179,640</ix:nonFraction></span>, as part of the compensation to these independent directors. The stock options granted shall vest in equal monthly installments
for 12 months, commencing on July 1, 2021 until June 30, 2022.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
June 28, 2022 and July 1, 2022, independent directors were granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber_iI_pid_c20220628__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--IndependentDirectorMember_zFQfWwzxUvwi" title="Number of shares granted options to purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber" contextRef="AsOf2022-06-28_custom_IndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004592" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,244</ix:nonFraction></span> and <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber_iI_pid_c20220701__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--IndependentDirectorMember_zb8o46WeiMyl" title="Number of shares granted options to purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber" contextRef="AsOf2022-07-01_custom_IndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004594" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,960</ix:nonFraction></span> shares* of the Company&#8217;s
Ordinary Shares, respectively, exercisable at $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20220628__20220628__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--IndependentDirectorMember_zKTiaUKPHcW9" title="Exercisable per share"><span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20220701__20220701__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--IndependentDirectorMember_zRWCuxO8S701" title="Exercisable per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2022-06-282022-06-28_custom_IndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004596" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2022-07-012022-07-01_custom_IndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004598" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.10</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> per share*. These stock options granted shall vest in equal monthly installments
for 12 months, with expired date of June 28, 2023 and July 1, 2023, respectively. Share-based compensation awards are measured at the
grant date fair value of the awards and recognized as expenses using the straight-line method over the service period.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 3, 2023, two independent directors were granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber_iI_pid_c20230803__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoIndependentDirectorMember_z1VjIDroi0nj" title="Number of shares granted options to purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber" contextRef="AsOf2023-08-03_custom_TwoIndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004600" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,875</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares* per director of the Company&#8217;s Ordinary Shares, respectively, exercisable at $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20230803__20230803__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoIndependentDirectorMember_zQy3AhNIvoq9" title="Exercisable per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2023-08-032023-08-03_custom_TwoIndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004602" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.10</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share* with a value of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueStockOptionsExercised_c20230803__20230803__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoIndependentDirectorMember_zP2KBYAHXlEb" title="Exercisable, value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueStockOptionsExercised" contextRef="From2023-08-032023-08-03_custom_TwoIndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004604" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per director. These stock options granted shall vest in equal monthly installments for 12 months, with expired date of July 31, 2024.
Share-based compensation awards are measured at the grant date fair value of the awards and recognized as expenses using the
straight-line method over the service period.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
October 3, 2023, two independent directors were granted options to purchase <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber_iI_pid_c20231003__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoIndependentDirectorMember_zKKdbHX00Iye" title="Number of shares granted options to purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber" contextRef="AsOf2023-10-03_custom_TwoIndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004606" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,061</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares* per director of the Company&#8217;s Ordinary Shares, respectively, exercisable at $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20231003__20231003__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoIndependentDirectorMember_zZGRL5hYcbv2" title="Exercisable per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2023-10-032023-10-03_custom_TwoIndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004608" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.10</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share* with a value of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueStockOptionsExercised_c20231003__20231003__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__custom--TwoIndependentDirectorMember_zKvP5u4o3I4a" title="Exercisable, value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueStockOptionsExercised" contextRef="From2023-10-032023-10-03_custom_TwoIndependentDirectorMember" id="Fact004610" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per director These stock options granted shall vest in equal monthly installments for 12 months, with expired date of July 31, 2024.
Share-based compensation awards are measured at the grant date fair value of the awards and recognized as expenses using the
straight-line method over the service period.</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-10-01to2024-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact004612" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardTextBlock"><p id="xdx_892_eus-gaap--DisclosureOfShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardTextBlock_zQuzgL7Jfkzl" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B9_zkdSpRIFUTFd" style="display: none">SHARE-BASED
