<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the six months ended March 31, 2024 and 2023, stock-based compensation associated with amortization of stock option expense was $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20231001__20240331__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_zh8y9Glqqkl8" title="Share based compensation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-03-31_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" id="Fact004634" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,009,836</ix:nonFraction></span>
and $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensation_c20221001__20230331__us-gaap--IncomeStatementLocationAxis__us-gaap--GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember_z3xdrWHoz8jj" title="Share based compensation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-03-31_us-gaap_GeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseMember" id="Fact004636" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">35,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. All stock-based compensation was recorded as a component of general and administrative expense.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

